{
  "id": "self-extension",
  "term": "self-extension",
  "definition": "Self-extension is the psychological process of experiencing something outside oneself, such as a social networking site, as part of one’s self-system. In this context, it means perceiving the platform as an extension of the self, which can help explain how people manage privacy boundaries there.",
